DESCRIPTION:Doors: 6:30 PM Show: 7:30 PM Age Limit: All Ages\nDoors: 6:30 P
	M Show: 7:30 PM Age Limit: All Ages No Resale Over Face Value: Loathe is u
	sing Ticketmaster's Face Value Exchange to help fans get tickets at the or
	iginal price. Tickets can only be resold on Ticketmaster at face value. St
	ates Blocking Artist Resale Terms: New York\, Illinois\, Colorado\, Virgin
